## Additional Terms for Research Use

### Citation Requirement
If you use this research in academic work, please cite:

Ahmad, F., Chacha, M., Lotachi, O., Badie, E., & Alvaro, A. (2025). The role of 
climate forecasts in shaping adaptation behaviour: Evidence from a cross-country survey. 
[Journal Name], XX(X), XX-XX.

### Data Use Agreement
- Data provided is for research purposes only
- Data must remain confidential and secure
- Data must not be redistributed without permission
- Any publications using this data must cite the original study

